For production:

```js
app.get('/users', async (req, res, next) => {
  try {
    const users = await userRepository.findAll();
    res.json(users);
  } catch (err) {
    next(err);
  }
});
```

For demo/dev purposes, put mock data in a separate fixture file or conditionally enable it only in non-production environments:

```js
if (process.env.NODE_ENV !== 'production') {
  app.get('/users', (req, res) => {
    res.json([
      { id: 1, name: 'Alice' },
      { id: 2, name: 'Bob' },
    ]);
  });
}
```

