### Risk

If this endpoint were connected to real data, it could leak personally identifiable information.

### Recommendation

Require authentication and authorization before returning users.

Example:

```js
app.get('/users', requireAuth, (req, res) => {
  res.json(users);
});
```

Also consider minimizing returned fields.

