  console.log('Server running on port 3000');
});
```

When no host is specified, Node commonly binds to all interfaces.

### Risk

In some deployment environments, this may expose the service more broadly than intended.

### Recommendation

Use environment-based configuration and optionally bind to a specific host.

```js
const PORT = process.env.PORT || 3000;
const HOST = process.env.HOST || '127.0.0.1';

