This is not directly a vulnerability, but it is less secure and less deployable than using environment-based configuration.

**Recommendation:**

```js
const PORT = process.env.PORT || 3000;

app.listen(PORT, () => {
  console.log(`Server running on port ${PORT}`);
});
```

---

